      "message": "Yeah. I\u0027ve got a similar patch (https://r.android.com/3166257) I was hoping to land last summer but it ran into power regression reports.\n\nFor some details, see slide 10 from Saravana\u0027s presentation from lpc last year:\nhttps://lpc.events/event/18/contributions/1842/attachments/1476/3126/LPC%202024%20-%20Wattson.pdf\n\nSome deeper analysis is needed there to better understand the cause. But I\u0027m also looking at a dynamic HZ approach (setting HZ\u003d1000, but allowing the actual interrupt frequency to come in at a slower rate - defaulting to 250hz, and handling batches of ticks together), but it will need some further effort before it is ready for use:\nhttps://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20250128063301.3879317-1-jstultz@google.com/",
